          "offset": 0,
          "before": "",
          "after": "## 2026-11-15 — Inventory R2 read scheduling candidate\n\nMeasured sequential aggregate waits in Tooling/equipment reads and lifecycle writes; opt into existing bounded scheduling while preserving complete records, ordered validation, receipts/CAS and original destructive paths. Three-pair synthetic before/after evidence and limits: [record](../docs/acceptance/tooling-equipment-speed-20261115/README.md). Independent speed draft only; no deployment/live-data action.\n\n"
        }
